## Integration acceptance

- Check decimal-comma and decimal-point formats, 12 and 24 hour display, and local and server time zone choices using the same underlying readings.
- Test the repeated hour on 25 October 2026 in Europe/London, and an all-day due date that must not shift.
- Check long and right-to-left text, note the limits of any language review and keep copied IDs exact.

Record the real environment, versions, state, method and result using [Native task accessibility and evidence](native-task-accessibility.html). Reviewing the source or a local example does not show that anything ran on a device, that a screen reader works or that it is compatible with a live installation.
